<title>Offline Reinforcement Learning with Conservative Value Ensembles</title>
<summary>  We study offline reinforcement learning where the agent must learn a policy from a fixed dataset. We propose conservative value ensembles that penalize out-of-distribution actions and improve policy optimization on D4RL benchmarks.
</summary>
<author><name>Maria García</name></author><author><name>Adrian Del Maestro</name></author><author><name>Wei Zhang</name></author>

