<title>A Benchmark for Evaluating Long-Context Reasoning in Large Language Models</title>
<summary>  We present a benchmark for the evaluation of large language models on long-context reasoning. The benchmark contains 5,000 questions and we evaluate 20 language models, finding that accuracy degrades with context length.
</summary>
<author><name>Sara Okafor</name></author><author><name>Jörg Müller</name></author>
