<title>Contamination Detection for Language Model Benchmarks</title>
<summary>  Benchmark contamination inflates evaluation scores of large language models. We propose a membership inference method to detect test set contamination in pretraining data.
</summary>
<author><name>Rui Silva</name></author><author><name>Sara Okafor</name></author>

